{"id":"efadc4e149119d7f","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-laplacian.md","title":"Laplacian","display":"df-laplacian — Laplacian","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-laplacian","aliases":["58-df-laplacian","Laplacian"],"display":"df-laplacian — Laplacian","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-laplacian"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-laplacian</span><span>Laplacian</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-laplacian — Laplacian"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"76305a7e4d824323\" href=\"?note=76305a7e4d824323\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md\">../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta,\\Delta_n,f\\in V\">\\(\\Delta,\\Delta_n,f\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^n=\\{x:\\mathrm{Function}(x,n,\\mathbb R)\\}\">\\(\\mathbb R^n=\\{x:\\mathrm{Function}(x,n,\\mathbb R)\\}\\)</span>，坐标从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 开始。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiffOp}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DiffOp}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb R)\">\\(C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb R)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76305a7e4d824323\" href=\"?note=76305a7e4d824323\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md\">../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md</a>。</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in n\">\\(i,j\\in n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_{ij}=1\\leftrightarrow i=j\">\\(\\delta_{ij}=1\\leftrightarrow i=j\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_{ij}=0\\leftrightarrow i\\ne j\">\\(\\delta_{ij}=0\\leftrightarrow i\\ne j\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Laplacian}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Laplacian}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laplacian}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Laplacian}_S(\\Delta,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{DiffOp}_S(\\Delta,\\mathbb R^n,n,2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb R)\\;\\exists y\\in(\\mathbb R^{\\mathbb R^n})^n\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\forall i\\in n\\;\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S\n\\left(y(i),f,\\mathbb R^n,n,\\{\\langle j,2\\delta_{ij}\\rangle:j\\in n\\}\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\n\\Delta(f)(x)=\\sum_{i\\in n}y(i)(x)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laplacian}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Laplacian}_S(\\Delta,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{DiffOp}_S(\\Delta,\\mathbb R^n,n,2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb R)\\;\\exists y\\in(\\mathbb R^{\\mathbb R^n})^n\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\forall i\\in n\\;\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S\n\\left(y(i),f,\\mathbb R^n,n,\\{\\langle j,2\\delta_{ij}\\rangle:j\\in n\\}\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\n\\Delta(f)(x)=\\sum_{i\\in n}y(i)(x)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laplacian\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Laplacian}_S(\\Delta_n,n)\\land f\\in C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb R)\n\\to\\Delta_nf=\\Delta_n(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laplacian\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Laplacian}_S(\\Delta_n,n)\\land f\\in C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb R)\n\\to\\Delta_nf=\\Delta_n(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Laplacian: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta = \\mathrm{div} \\circ \\nabla\">\\(\\Delta = \\mathrm{div} \\circ \\nabla\\)</span>, sum of second partial derivatives</li>\n<li>Harmonic: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta f = 0\">\\(\\Delta f = 0\\)</span>, mean-value property</li>\n<li>Spectrum: eigenvalues of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-\\Delta\">\\(-\\Delta\\)</span> on bounded domain</li>\n<li>Hodge Laplacian: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta = dd^* + d^*d\">\\(\\Delta = dd^* + d^*d\\)</span> on forms</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Evans, Partial Differential Equations</li>\n<li>Gilbarg and Trudinger, Elliptic Partial Differential Equations</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"76305a7e4d824323","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"76305a7e4d824323","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DiffOp}_S$、$\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S$ 与 $C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb R)$ 使用 [[../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta,\\Delta_n,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^n=\\{x:\\mathrm{Function}(x,n,\\mathbb R)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DiffOp}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S","display":false},{"tex":"C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"i,j\\in n","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_{ij}=1\\leftrightarrow i=j","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_{ij}=0\\leftrightarrow i\\ne j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Laplacian}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laplacian}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Laplacian}_S(\\Delta,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{DiffOp}_S(\\Delta,\\mathbb R^n,n,2)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall f\\in C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb R)\\;\\exists y\\in(\\mathbb R^{\\mathbb R^n})^n\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&\\qquad\\forall i\\in n\\;\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S\n\\left(y(i),f,\\mathbb R^n,n,\\{\\langle j,2\\delta_{ij}\\rangle:j\\in n\\}\\right)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\n\\Delta(f)(x)=\\sum_{i\\in n}y(i)(x)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laplacian\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Laplacian}_S(\\Delta_n,n)\\land f\\in C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb R)\n\\to\\Delta_nf=\\Delta_n(f).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta = \\mathrm{div} \\circ \\nabla","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta f = 0","display":false},{"tex":"-\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta = dd^* + d^*d","display":false}],"bytes":1761,"backlinks":[{"id":"a28bcf113a6c9da0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Laplacian}_S(\\Delta_n,n)$ is the Euclidean Laplacian predicate from [[../batch02/58-df-laplacian.md]]."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-759","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-laplacian.md|58-df-laplacian]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["76305a7e4d824323"]}